Deploy scripts write <chainId>.json here, and generateTsAbis.js reads it to produce
packages/nextjs/contracts/deployedContracts.ts.

This file exists so the directory survives a clone. Git does not track empty directories, and
foundry.toml grants read-write fs_permissions on this path, so without it the first deploy fails
at vm.writeJson with "No such file or directory" after every contract has already been deployed.
